@startuml FIG-CL-TAV-08
skinparam shadowing false
title FIG-CL-TAV-08 Parametric\nSysML 1.6 notation-based views; executable/metamodel conformance is not claimed\nconstraints shown, not claimed solved

constraint I_allow as "I : allowed timing interval"
constraint eps as "epsilon : measurement error bound"
constraint J_meas as "J : feasible interval from measurement"
constraint cmin_b as "cmin > 0 and cost(t) >= cmin\nand cost(ERROR) >= cmin"
constraint budget as "B finite OR Kmax finite"
constraint score as "s(t) = worst remaining |Hk|\nover Obs(t,qk)"
constraint update as "Hk+1 = {h in Hk | O(h,t,qk) intersects Izk}"

I_allow .. J_meas
eps .. J_meas
J_meas .. update
cmin_b .. budget
score .. update
budget .. score

note bottom
  Positive-but-vanishing costs are not a termination proof.
  ERROR is under the same chosen constraint as ordinary tests.
  Parametric view displays constraints; it does not claim they are solved.
end note
@enduml
